# OPENSTRIKERS_TEST_AUTO_REPLAY: trigger a goal replay without scoring a goal.
#
# Verifying the replay path otherwise means playing until the AI scores, which
# is slow and not reproducible. With this set, once the buffer holds ~6s the
# hook fills in GoalScoredData, forces a SHOT_AT_GOAL event and calls
# PlayAutoReplay(REPLAY_TYPE_GOAL), then returns to gameplay when the choreo
# reports done, printing AUTO_REPLAY_TEST begin/end/completed to stderr.
#
# Inert unless the environment variable is set. This is how patch 106 was
# verified; keep it until replays survive a real match unattended.
